  "next-page": "Pagina tsi yini",
  "previous-page": "Pagina di dininti",
  "heading-notes": "Note",
  "globalSearch-instructions-heading": "Instructsii di cãftari",
  "globalSearch-instructions-description": "Cãutãrili pot s-includã operatori ti unã cãutari ma precisã. Operatorlji s-scriu cu numa shi valoarea separati di doauã puncti. Di exemplu, `list:Blocked` limiteadzã cãutarea la cãrtsãli di lista numitã *Blocked*. Dacã valoarea ari spatsii icã caractersi spetsiali, lipsea s-hibã închisã tu ghilimeali (di exemplu `__operator_list__:\"To Review\"`).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operators": "Operatori tsi pot s-hibã utilizats:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-board": "`__operator_board__:<title>` - cãrtsã tu tabelili tsi corespundu la *<title>* specificat",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-list": "`__operator_list__:<title>` - cãrtsã tu listili tsi corespundu la *<title>* specificat",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-swimlane": "`__operator_swimlane__:<title>` - cãrtsã tu culoarili tsi corespundu la *<title>* specificat",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-comment": "`__operator_comment__:<text>` - cãrtsã cu un comentariu tsi ari *<text>*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-label": "`__operator_label__:<color>` `__operator_label__:<name>` - cãrtsã cu etichetã tsi corespundi la *<color>* icã *<name>",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-hash": "`__operator_label_abbrev__<name|color>` - formã scurtã trã `__operator_label__:<color>` i `__operator_label__:<name>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-user": "`__operator_user__:<username>` - cãrtsã iu *<username>* easti *membru* icã *persoanã atribuitã*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-at": "`__operator_user_abbrev__username` - formã scurtã ti `user:<username>`",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-member": "`__operator_member__:<username>` - cãrtsã iu *<username>* easti un *membru*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-assignee": "`__operator_assignee__:<username>` - cãrtsã iu *<username>* easti unã *persoanã atribuitã*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-creator": "`__operator_creator__:<username>` - tarjetas donde *<username>* es el creador di la tarjeta",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-org": "`__operator_org__:<display name|short name>` - cartes appartenant à un tableau attribué à l'organisation *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-team": "`__operator_team__:<display name|short name>` - las tarjetas pertenecientes al tablero asignadas al equipo *<name>*",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-due": "`__operator_due__:<n>` -  tarjetas que vencen dentro di *<n>* days.  `__operator_due__:__predicate_overdue__ lista todas las tarjetas que han vencido.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-created": "`__operator_created__:<n>` - cãrtsã creati cu *<n>* dzãli ninti icã ma recent",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-modified": "`__operator_modified__:<n>` - cãrtsã alãxati cu *<n>* dzãli ninti icã ma recent",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-status": "`__operator_status__:<status>` - iu *<status>* easti un di aestili:",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-archived": "`__predicate_archived__` - cãrtsã arhivati",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-all": "`__predicate_all__` - tuti cãrtsãli arhivati shi niarhivati",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-ended": "`__predicate_ended__` - cãrtsã cu datã di bitisiri",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-public": "`__predicate_public__` - cãrtsã mash tu tabeli publici",
  "globalSearch-instructions-status-private": "`__predicate_private__` - cãrtsã mash tu tabeli privati",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-has": "`__operator_has__:<field>` - iu *<field>* easti un di `__predicate_attachment__`, `__predicate_checklist__`, `__predicate_description__`, `__predicate_start__`, `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_end__`, `__predicate_assignee__` icã `__predicate_member__`. Dacã puni un `-` ninti di *<field>*, cautã lipsa di valoari tu aestu cãmpu (di exemplu `has:-due` cautã cãrtsã fãrã datã di termen).",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-sort": "`__operator_sort__:<sort-name>` - iu *<sort-name>* easti un di `__predicate_due__`, `__predicate_created__` icã `__predicate_modified__`. Ti arãndari descendentã, puni un `-` ninti a numãljei di arãndari.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-operator-limit": "`__operator_limit__:<n>` - iu *<n>* easti un numir întreg pozitiv tsi aratã numirlu di cãrtsã ti afishari pi paginã.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-1": "Pot s-hibã specificats ma multi operatori.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-2": "Operatorlji similari s-combinã cu *OR*. Suntu arãtati cãrtsãli tsi corespundu la vãrã unã di conditsii.\n`__operator_list__:Available __operator_list__:Blocked` aratã cãrtsãli di listili numiti *Blocked* icã *Available*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3": "Operatorlji diferenti s-combinã cu *AND*. Suntu arãtati mash cãrtsãli tsi corespundu la tuts operatorlji diferenti. `__operator_list__:Available __operator_label__:red` aratã mash cãrtsãli di lista *Available* cu eticheta *red*.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-3-2": "Dzãlili pot s-hibã specificati ca numir întreg pozitiv icã negativ, icã cu `__predicate_week__`, `__predicate_month__`, `__predicate_quarter__` icã `__predicate_year__` ti perioada curentã.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-4": "Cãftãrli di text nu fac dispãrtsãri ãntrã grãmãtsi mãri shi njits.",
  "globalSearch-instructions-notes-5": "Di ahurhitã, cãrtsãli arhivati nu s-cautã.",
